!
!Dissociative Adsorption, Hydrogen desorption mechanism
!to be used with evengas mechanism
!fit to our rsc data 27 Jun 91
!hydrogen desorption from PRL 62(89)567
!version 2: uses COV trick to get first order reaction
!1.754E20 = 7.9e11/(2 * SDEN)
SITE/SILICON/          SDEN/2.2524E-09/
  SI(S)
  SIH(S)
END
BULK   SI(D)         /2.33/
END
THERMO ALL
  300.      600.     1685.
