 0.97593603E-08-0.27279380E-11-0.52486288E 03-0.45272678E 01                   4
SI(D)             J 3/67SI  1    0    0    0S   300.000  1685.000              1
 0.24753989E 01 0.88112187E-03-0.20939481E-06 0.42757187E-11 0.16006564E-13    2
-0.81255620E 03-0.12188747E 02 0.84197538E 00 0.83710416E-02-0.13077030E-04    3
 0.97593603E-08-0.27279380E-11-0.52486288E 03-0.45272678E 01                   4
END

REACTIONS
   SIH4     + 2SI(S) => 2SIH(S) +  SI(D) + H2   8.39E26    0.0   37450.0
   2SIH(S)          => 2SI(S)  +  H2            1.754E20   0.0   47000.0
                                                COV/SIH(S) 0.0 -1.0 0.0/
   SIH2             => SI(D)   +  H2            1.0        0.0   0.0
                                                STICK
   SI               => SI(D)                    1.0        0.0   0.0
                                                STICK
   SI2H6    + 2SI(S) => 2SIH(S) + 2SI(D) + 2H2  8.39E27    0.0   37450.0
   H2SISIH2         => 2SI(D)  + 2H2            1.0        0.0   0.0
                                                STICK
   H3SISIH          => 2SI(D)  + 2H2            1.0        0.0   0.0
                                                STICK
   SI3H8    + 2SI(S) => 2SIH(S) + 3SI(D) +3H2   8.39E27    0.0   37450.0
